Package: decisions
Version: 0.1.0
Title: Typed Decisions from Decision Models
Description: Sends texts and images to decision models: hosted or local
    models that return a probability for each allowed answer to a typed
    question (true or false, a choice, or an ordered score). Supports the
    web services of 'TypeSafe' <https://typesafe.ai>, 'OpenAI'
    <https://platform.openai.com>, 'OpenRouter' <https://openrouter.ai> and
    'Microsoft Foundry' <https://ai.azure.com>, which need an API
    (application programming interface) key and can charge for each call,
    and any local or hosted server that uses the 'SystemOne' request format.
    Returns one row for each input in the 'tidymodels' style, saves and
    scores a complete decision setup, and applies a calibrator fitted with
    'probably'. Includes injury reports
    from the Severe Injury Reports of the U.S. Occupational Safety and Health
    Administration <https://www.osha.gov/severe-injury-reports>, food recall
    reports of the U.S. Food and Drug Administration
    <https://open.fda.gov/apis/food/enforcement/>, and simulated textile
    images made with 'spc4sts', Bui and Apley (2021)
    <doi:10.1080/00224065.2019.1707730>.
